CONST|id=K60|name=vortex detector|value=plaquette winding = signed crossings of the positive real axis by its 4 corner values (i128 cross products; a plaquette with an exactly-zero corner is skipped); counted if the corner rho sum >= 0.08, the mean rho over the surrounding 6 x 6 cells >= 0.4 and the signed distance to every solid >= 0.5; V(t) = sum abs(w)|units=-|tag=DEFINED|source=lane 2 design|verified=1|used_by=HF-G04, HF-G05, HF-G06, HF-G07|json=0
CONST|id=K61|name=phase-slip counter (G1)|value=N_slip(t) = (Phi_AB(t) - Phi_path(t) - Phi_AB(t_ref) + Phi_path(t_ref))/(2 pi), an exact integer, with t_ref the first valid record at t >= 64: Phi_AB = arg(psi_B conj psi_A) unwrapped record to record from t = 0 (A the inner-bath cell centred at (48 - dx/2, 16 + dx/2), B its mirror image, the outer-bath cell centred at (160 + dx/2, 16 + dx/2)); Phi_path = sum of principal arg increments along a fixed cell path 2 xi from the solid (A, up the inner face, over the cap, down the outer face, B); arg by certified integer CORDIC; a record with any path cell rho < 0.05 is not valid and is skipped; N_slip is defined only on valid records at t >= t_ref, and a rung is classified dissipative (V > 0 or N_slip != 0) only on records at t >= 64|units=-|tag=DEFINED|source=this synthesis (referee point 9: V(t) counts vortices present, not crossings); referenced at t_ref in the fix pass|verified=1|note=Phi_path(0) is undefined: at t = 0 the rim barrier B = 4 is on, so the path cells over the cap have rho < 0.05 and the t = 0 record is not valid|used_by=HF-G05, HF-G06, HF-G07|json=0
